      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CLIFTON (3) has been in the minor money at both career runs, the latest finishing second (23.05) at this track. Tough to beat if runs up to recent form. BIG RED ACES (2) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten 5 lengths into second (23.61) at this track in a Maiden over 400m. Can measure up. BOTOX CHEVY (1) struggling for winning form, but gets every chance from the inside. Last time finished last in a Maiden on November 7 over 400m at this track behind Ripper Mulwee beaten 17 lengths (24.15). One of the better hopes. FASCINATE VICKI (6) was unplaced here when making debut but gets her chance to atone.",
